ambria,serif;\"&gt;Pouches were used for Survival Kits that included tissues, aloe, medications, hand sanitizer, etc. for each OOT Guest&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;$ 8.00 (QTY 8)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;Centerpieces -- Yankee Candle Aqua Glass Tealight Holders - NEW&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;I bought these to use for Centerpieces, but was subsequently told by the Atlantis that I could not use any glass items for decorations as the Reception was outdoors on a patio.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;$ 100.00 (QTY 5)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;Centerpieces - Capiz Seashell Trays - USED&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;*This price includes the trays and Tiffany Blue Sand and seashell, seaglass and starfish accessories - CANDLES NOT INCLUDED&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;$ 75.00 (QTY 4)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;Wishing Tree and Accessories - USED&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;$ 50.00&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Tree Twig Glitter 32in Silver&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Crystal Garland Acrylic 5ft Clear (Qty 2)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Light 20ct LED Bead Garland&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Framed Sign&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;Sea Dune Grass Decorations - USED&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;$ 30.00 (QTY 2)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"color:#2a2a2a;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;2 White Starfish 3\" to 4\" w- Dried Dune Grass&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;Light LED FloraLytes Submersible White - NEW&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;$ 15.00 (QTY 1 PKG of 10)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;Tealight Battery Operated 6\/Package* - NEW&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;$ 15.00 (QTY 30 TEALIGHTS TOTAL)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;Raffia Waterfall 12oz Natural - NEW&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;$ 3.00&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;Starfish Aisle Markers - USED&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;$ 50.00 (Qty 10)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1746212,"PostDate":1365766892,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am Spring Cleaning and clearing out the remnants from our wedding in December. \u00a0Some of the items were never used. \u00a0It was raining in the Bahamas when we arrived, and we ended up changing the location from an outdoor patio area to an indoor conference room. \u00a0No time to decorate, so a lot of things did not get used. \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Buyer pays shipping. \u00a0I live and work in the Washington DC\/Northern VA area, so would be willing to also meet someone for pickup. \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Please let me know if you have any questions!!! \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">90\" Round Organza Seamless Table Overlay \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Tiffany Blue - USED ONCE<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">$ 25.00 (QTY 5)<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">20\"x20\" Satin Napkins \u00e2\u20ac\u201c TiffanyBlue\/Aqua - NEW<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">$ 25.00 (QTY 4 - 10 PCS PKS Plus extras from an opened pkg)<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">12\u00e2\u20ac\u009dx116\u00e2\u20ac\u009d Organza Sash \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Ivory - NEW<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">$ 50.00 (QTY 50)<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">Wedding Tropics Linen Attire Samples<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">$ 10.00<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">*Embroidery Thread Color Sample Booklet<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">*Shirts, Pants & Dresses Samples (White, Ivory, Ecru)<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">*Pants Sample -- Khaki<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">3x3x3 Turquoise Favor Box-100pc - NEW<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">$ 20.00 (QTY 76 boxes)<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">Favors - Yankee Candle Votive Holders - NEW<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">$ 25.00 (5 bxs of 3 - 15 votive holders)<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">ID Badge Holder \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Resealable, Vertical Orientation, 2.625 x 3.75 Inches, Pre-Punched, NEW<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">$ 10.00 (Qty 25)<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">8 Blank Cotton Bags \u00e2\u20ac\u201c NEW<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"color:rgb(44,44,44)\"><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\">Size: 22\"w x 15\"h w\/ 5\" bottom gusset and 25\" handles<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">$ 15.00 (QTY 8)<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">8 X 6 X 1-1\/2 SOFT VINYL SLIDE-ZIP POUCH (10 Pouches) \u00e2\u20ac\u201c NEW<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">Pouches were used for Survival Kits that included tissues, aloe, medications, hand sanitizer, etc. for each OOT Guest<\/span><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">$ 8.00 (QTY 8)<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">Centerpieces -- Yankee Candle Aqua Glass Tealight Holders - NEW<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">I bought these to use for Centerpieces, but was subsequently told by the Atlantis that I could not use any glass items for decorations as the Reception was outdoors on a patio.<\/span><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">$ 100.00 (QTY 5)<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">Centerpieces - Capiz Seashell Trays - USED<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">*This price includes the trays and Tiffany Blue Sand and seashell, seaglass and starfish accessories - CANDLES NOT INCLUDED<\/span><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">$ 75.00 (QTY 4)<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">Wishing Tree and Accessories - USED<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">$ 50.00<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> Tree Twig Glitter 32in Silver<\/p> <p> Crystal Garland Acrylic 5ft Clear (Qty 2)<\/p> <p> Light 20ct LED Bead Garland<\/p> <p> Framed Sign\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">Sea Dune Grass Decorations - USED<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">$ 30.00 (QTY 2)<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"color:#2a2a2a\"><span  style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">2 White Starfish 3\" to 4\" w- Dried Dune Grass<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">Light LED FloraLytes Submersible White - NEW<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">$ 15.00 (QTY 1 PKG of 10)<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">Tealight Battery Operated 6\/Package* - NEW<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">$ 15.00 (QTY 30 TEALIGHTS TOTAL)<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">Raffia Waterfall 12oz Natural - NEW<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">$ 3.00<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">Starfish Aisle Markers - USED<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">$ 50.00 (Qty 10)<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tripledobedare@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"96.231.156.71","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1345162376,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259268.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dobedare","Id":259268,"Name":"dobedare","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"23.113.184.235","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73605,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"61a06592595fa5a2c07be606752f89a9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"dobedare\"] &amp;nbsp;I am interested in many of these items...can you tell me what is still available and do you have any pictures....&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1896533,"PostDate":1431953858,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p