help and they are AWESOME!!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":352078,"PostDate":1214187279,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I have to ask.....exactly what type of inkjet did you buy that worked on the glossy cardstock. I tried going to kinkos but they will not do the color on it because it will not work in their machine. So if I need to but one, I would rather buy one that I know will work on the cardstock <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Thanks for your help and they are AWESOME!!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"beebumble27@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1199946257,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208188.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"beebumble27","Id":208188,"Name":"beebumble27","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":15009,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1a59fe485023e5e6d856c8a3f1cbe954","RawContent":"These are great, thank you!","Attachments":[],"Id":352196,"PostDate":1214199783,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  bod