d":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1181252160,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207447.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MsShelley","Id":207447,"Name":"MsShelley","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":15009,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"db8f66b4bae1ea1cb99d11f701c2caa1","RawContent":"So adorable!\n \n I would love to use this template on my own, but I&#039;m wondering where you got the paper, etc...Could you explain that process a bit? I&#039;m thinking of getting them done through a printer, as I don&#039;t own one myself.","Attachments":[],"Id":352424,"PostDate":1214231115,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                So adorable!<br \/> <br \/> I would love to use this template on my own, but I'm wondering where you got the paper, etc...Could you explain that process a bit? I'm thinking of getting them done through a printer, as I don't own one myself.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong>31 booked so far!!<\/strong><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1156\/527\/20090620\/Our+Wedding\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1156\/...ing\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"katykosa@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1212005014,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209626.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":83,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KatyKo","Id":209626,"Name":"KatyKo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":15009,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"614f238c5acaa64cf069f03692c91810","RawContent":"They look great! Congrats on a wonderful job.","Attachments":[],"Id":353292,"PostDate":1214259694,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                They look great! Congrats on a wonderful job.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yari2566@mac.com","IpAddress":"173.60.223.125","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1188371880,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207684.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Yari","Id":207684,"Name":"Yari","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":15009,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"06962af320b59e0eb9ff645261f76a11","RawContent":"Super cute! Great job!","Attachments":[],"Id":353298,"PostDate":1214260154,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Super cute! Great job!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"clc744@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1178587254,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207392.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Cassondra2009","Id":207392,"Name":"Cassondra2009","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":15009,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"70a2c1e84a0132b9e4ae4a2ab8538c36","RawContent":"Here are all the pictures below...\n \n I used cover paper that you can get at Michaels. I found it a bit cheaper through a wholesale paper company but it is identical to the sparkly stuff they sell at Michaels. Laser printers will not work for metallic like paper! I tried 3! I printed that on a Lexmark 2500 all in one which feeds from the top and comes out the front. This is a must! anything that has to make a sharp turn won&#039;t work. I got that printer at Wal-Mart for about $50 I think. \n \n The inside sheets are HP brochure paper. Kinda slick and about 28 lb I think. No see through at all. Those I printed on a color laser printer but an inkjet would have done them too. \n \n I used Word to print the envelopes, again must be on a printer that feeds from the top and comes out the front or you will have marks on the envelope. I stamped the back and used a pretty stamp.\n \n Any other questions please ask. I cannot take credit for all of this as I learned and borrowed from others on here!\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i303.photobucket.com\/albums\/nn123\/mindej\/P1000917.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i303.photobucket.com\/albums\/nn123\/mindej\/P1000918.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/http:\/\/i303.photobucket.com\/albums\/nn123\/mindej\/P1000919.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i303.photobucket.com\/albums\/nn123\/mindej\/P1000921.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i303.photobucket.com\/albums\/nn123\/mindej\/P1000922.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i303.photobucket.com\/albums\/nn123\/mindej\/P1000923.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i303.photobucket.com\/albums\/nn123\/mindej\/P1000924.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":368998,"PostDate":1215282304,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Here are all the pictures below...<br \/> <br \/> I used cover paper that you can get at Michaels. I found it a bit cheaper through a wholesale paper company but it is identical to the sparkly stuff they sell at Michaels. Laser printers will not work for metallic like paper! I tried 3! I printed that on a Lexmark 2500 all in one which feeds from the top and comes out the front. This is a must! anything that has to make a sharp turn won't work. I got that printer at Wal-Mart for about $50 I think. <br \/> <br \/> The inside sheets are HP brochure paper. Kinda slick and about 28 lb I think. No see through at all. Those I printed on a color laser printer but an inkjet would have done them too. <br \/> <br \/> I used Word to print the envelopes, again must be on a printer that feeds from the top and comes out the front or you will have marks on the envelope. I stamped the back and used a pretty stamp.<br \/> <br \/> Any other questions please ask. I cannot take credit for all of this as I learned and borrowed from others on here!<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i303.photobucket.com\/albums\/nn123\/mindej\/P1000917.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i303.photobucket.com\/albums\/nn123\/mindej\/P1000918.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/http:\/\/i303.photobucket.com\/albums\/nn123\/mindej\/P1000919.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i303.photobucket.com\/albums\/nn123\/mindej\/P1000921.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i303.photobucket.com\/albums\/nn123\/mindej\/P1000922.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i303.photobucket.com\/albums\/nn123\/mindej\/P1000923.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i303.photobucket.com\/albums\/nn123\/mindej\/P1000924.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20081005\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-1\/k\/f0c4\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...f0c4\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"minde_johnsen@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1203264665,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208567.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Minde","Id":208567,"Name":"Minde","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":15009,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c0ea6d7457b75041cbc8c7bed4749c42","RawContent":"they are so profe