' alt=':)' \/> \u00a0If you're interested in reading a few recent reviews from brides here on BDWF as well as del Sol, please take a look here!\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"colby-violetmermaid5.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/502092\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>brendee2005<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I love the barefoor jewelry idea!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"redibychelsea@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1245205537,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218520.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bondgirl0072010","Id":218520,"Name":"bondgirl0072010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"56f29fb98323b4597613dd58bdfcbffc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks! From what I&#039;ve seen, you really have beautiful jewlery! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1496675,"PostDate":1312211516,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks! From what I've seen, you really have beautiful jewlery! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jwed12@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1296988223,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236433.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":292,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jwed12","Id":236433,"Name":"Jwed12","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2ba4919fde5ac68bdffaef30fa6c7b5b","RawContent":"Thanks so much :)\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Jwed12[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Thanks! From what I&#039;ve seen, you really have beautiful jewlery! :)[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1496695,"PostDate":1312214078,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks so much <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Jwed12<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Thanks! From what I've seen, you really have beautiful jewlery! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"redibychelsea@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1245205537,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218520.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bondgirl0072010","Id":218520,"Name":"bondgirl0072010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"22c2848de2457eb0316c29c2c83dcb76","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I am struggling with this! I think I&#039;m going to do a horseback excursion for my BM&#039;s, an OOT bag with a few extra goodies, and a necklace. I found these 2 on Etsy and I can&#039;t decide between them:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Seller is Kookime.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Screen shot 2011-08-04 at 7.37.36 PM.png\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/505742\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Screen shot 2011-08-04 at 7.37.46 PM.png\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/505745\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1499501,"PostDate":1312494326,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am struggling with this! I think I'm going to do a horseback excursion for my BM's, an OOT bag with a few extra goodies, and a necklace. I found these 2 on Etsy and I can't decide between them:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Seller is Kookime.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Screen shot 2011-08-04 at 7.37.36 PM.png\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/505742\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Screen shot 2011-08-04 at 7.37.46 PM.png\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/505745\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Brad & Janine - November 10th, 2011.<\/span><br><span>Valentin Imperial Maya, Riviera Maya<\/span><br><span>Bride & Groom + 29<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"janine_bolton@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1282590738,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231642.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JBean","Id":231642,"Name":"JBean","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5fd535ff2450aa907c881ce74f440400","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Wow! They are both really cute, but I think I like the bow one better. It makes more of a statement, and it&#039;s flirty and fun. Great find! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1499736,"PostDate":1312530309,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Wow! They are both really cute, but I think I like the bow one better. It makes more of a statement, and it's flirty and fun. Great find! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jwed12@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1296988223,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236433.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":292,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jwed12","Id":236433,"Name":"Jwed12","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f1974e25274698ad3d1cf197ab8e84c3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We are doing necklaces, earrings, tan extender from Victorias Secret, personalized beachchair covers, junior bridesmaid and flower girl are getting a swimsuit also. But I need something else for my MOH can&#039;t figure that one out yet :(&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1499737,"PostDate":1312530702,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We are doing necklaces, earrings, tan extender from Victorias Secret, personalized beachchair covers, junior bridesmaid and flower girl are getting a swimsuit also. But I need something else for my MOH can't figure that one out yet <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sllefebvr@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"64.223.108.246","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1298503181,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237131.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":157,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sllefebvr","Id":237131,"Name":"Sllefebvr","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"77cae59ed7c336dac86e28f28ee6e184","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; For anyone who&#039;s interested, the Knot has some really good sales if you sign up there. I got each of my bridesmaids a different colored canvas beach bag with their monogram on it for 7 bucks a peice. Right now they&#039;re having a great sale on jewlery and personalized cuff links for guys.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1500450,"PostDate":1312653249,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> For anyone who's interested, the Knot has some really good sales if you sign up there. I got each of my bridesmaids a different colored canvas beach bag with their monogram on it for 7 bucks a peice. Right now they're having a great sale on jewlery and personalized cuff links for guys.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jwed12@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1296988223,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236433.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":292,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jwed12","Id":236433,"Name":"Jwed12","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"951686826a69ce80c6327c2a3552b41d","RawContent":"Hey Sllefebvr! If you&#039;re looking for something special for your MOH, have you considered custom jewelry? I designed each one of my bridesmaids\/MOH their own pieces to make it as unique of an experience as their own personalities. Another thing I did to personalize the experience, was I added handwritten notes inside of each jewelry box that included memories that we had together :) If you need any inspiration, here is my site :) [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/508295\/width\/1000\/height\/500[\/img] \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/508297\/width\/1000\/height\/500[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/508299\/width\/1000\/height\/500[\/img]\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Sllefebvr[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n We are doing necklaces, earrings, tan extender from Victorias Secret, personalized beachchair covers, junior bridesmaid and flower girl are getting a swimsuit also. But I need something else for my MOH can&#039;t figure that one out yet :([\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1500838,"PostDate":1312759799,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey Sllefebvr! If you're looking for something special for your MOH, have you considered custom jewelry? I designed each one of my bridesmaids\/MOH their own pieces to make it as unique of an experience as their own personalities. Another thing I did to personalize the experience, was I added handwritten notes inside of each jewelry box that included memories that we had together <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> If you need any inspiration, here is my site <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Chelsea+Eric_W_0018.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/508295\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Chelsea+Eric_W_0137.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/508297\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> <\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Chelsea+Eric_W_0333.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/508299\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Sllefebvr<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> We are doing necklaces, earrings, tan extender from Victorias Secret, personalized beachchair covers, junior bridesmaid and flower girl are getting a swimsuit also. But I need something else for my MOH can't figure that one out yet <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"redibychelsea@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1245205537,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218520.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bondgirl0072010","Id":218520,"Name":"bondgirl0072010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d02d6b20b0ee3123a4a887b3bc310603","RawContent":"I apologize, I just read that you said you were already doing necklaces &amp;amp; earrings...so the barefoot jewelry would be my suggestion! Tired eyes - sheesh!! :)\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]bondgirl0072010[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hey Sllefebvr! If you&#039;re looking for something special for your MOH, have you considered custom jewelry? I designed each one of my bridesmaids\/MOH their own pieces to make it as unique of an experience as their own personalities. Another thing I did to personalize the experience, was I added handwritten notes inside of each jewelry box that included memories that we had together :) If you need any inspiration, here is my site :) [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/508295\/width\/1000\/height\/500[\/img] \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/508297\/width\/1000\/height\/500[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/508299\/width\/1000\/height\/500[\/img]\n   \n \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1500839,"PostDate":1312759854,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I apologize, I just read that you said you were already doing necklaces & earrings...so the barefoot jewelry would be my suggestion! Tired eyes - sheesh!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>bondgirl0072010<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hey Sllefebvr! If you're looking for something special for your MOH, have you considered custom jewelry? I designed each one of my bridesmaids\/MOH their own pieces to make it as unique of an experience as their own personalities. Another thing I did to personalize the experience, was I added handwritten notes inside of each jewelry box that included memories that we had together <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> If you need any inspiration, here is my site <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Chelsea+Eric_W_0018.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/508295\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Chelsea+Eric_W_0137.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/508297\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Chelsea+Eric_W_0333.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/508299\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"redibychelsea@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1245205537,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218520.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bondgirl0072010","Id":218520,"Name":"bondgirl0072010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"995981af890ef4a42ff42efa902cff8c","RawContent":"wow that is awesome!!! i could never afford that! but that is truely awesome that you are doing that! i am buying personalized wine glasses from etsy! [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]JayKay[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n We are paying for their dresses, hair, jewelry and makeup, so we are only going for small gifts.  I got them passport covers off etsy and flip cameras.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1500875,"PostDate":1312766455,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> wow that is awesome!!! i could never afford that! but that is truely awesome that you are doing that! i am buying personalized wine glasses from etsy!<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>JayKay<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> We are paying for their dresses, hair, jewelry and makeup, so we are only going for small gifts.\u00a0 I got them passport covers off etsy and flip cameras.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>All because, two people fell in love!<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jenniebootles@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"141.106.82.66","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1309396394,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241781.jpg?_r=1424182685","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Gin Bootles","Id":241781,"Name":"Gin Bootles","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":74,"TotalPages":8,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":70},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
