se,"PostKey":"e7a2b268e4ab33272be2b664be697c39","RawContent":"[quote name=\"kellymiller\" post=\"1872387\" timestamp=\"1411170498\"]\nWe are probably just going to do a photo book of some of our wedding pictures for our parents. We figure that is something they would like to have![\/quote]Ohhh fantastic idea. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1872389,"PostDate":1411156619,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>kellymiller, on 19 September 2014 - 07:48 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>We are probably just going to do a photo book of some of our wedding pictures for our parents. We figure that is something they would like to have!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nOhhh fantastic idea. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.65.179.70","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78048,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bba929728419b06833a2895212cc8b4c","RawContent":"That&#039;s a great idea! Are you telling them or just surprising them after?","Attachments":[],"Id":1872464,"PostDate":1411235495,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                That's a great idea! Are you telling them or just surprising them after? \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"morgan.rene1@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.87.153.227","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1410347199,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279766.jpg?_r=1410362818","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MorganRene","Id":279766,"Name":"MorganRene","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78048,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0a2add2cdb2e57dd1eb2995edc380a63","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I personally think it would be a nice surprise.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Since I don&#039;t think any parent expects a gift on your wedding day, I think it would be nice to surprise them!! &amp;nbsp;They are a terrific idea and we decided last night we would do this for our parents. Will probably make them thru Costco!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872465,"PostDate":1411235984,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I personally think it would be a nice surprise.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Since I don't think any parent expects a gift on your wedding day, I think it would be nice to surprise them!! \u00a0They are a terrific idea and we decided last night we would do this for our parents. Will probably make them thru Costco!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.67.117.232","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78048,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3594c47d7bf9b0465d311070144ef1ee","RawContent":"My husband got me an embroidery machine for Mother&#039;s Day and I ended up making handkerchiefs for both of my parents. For my dad I wrote, \"I will always be your little girl.\" And for my mom I put \"Mom\" in a heart. We got married in June!! Unfortunately both of my husbands parents have passed [emoji17]\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1872560,"PostDate":1411336697,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                My husband got me an embroidery machine for Mother's Day and I ended up making handkerchiefs for both of my parents. For my dad I wrote, \"I will always be your little girl.\" And for my mom I put \"Mom\" in a heart. We got married in June!! Unfortunately both of my husbands parents have passed [emoji17]<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amandambeals@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.67.117.232","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399587755,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277904.jpg?_r=1399604134","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"abeals11388","Id":277904,"Name":"abeals11388","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.87.234.180","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78048,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1e4e382b109b6eb5936a2c108bfea327","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I love the photo book idea. &amp;nbsp;I think I will do that, and just find something small for everyone for before&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872619,"PostDate":1411384046,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I love the photo book idea. \u00a0I think I will do that, and just find something small for everyone for before<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"morgan.rene1@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.87.153.227","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1410347199,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279766.jpg?_r=1410362818","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MorganRene","Id":279766,"Name":"MorganRene","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.19.180.168","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78048,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6235f38ce2643f21618bd1c4b939206c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We&#039;ve been picking up some small, special things for our moms to put in their OOT bags. &amp;nbsp;Clear, waterproof cases for their iPads that allow them to use the touch screen and these beach bags that have a flap and mesh bottom for emptying out sand (I think they&#039;re called Shake bags). &amp;nbsp;We are also giving our dads a cigar bar \"credit\" and moms a spa \"credit\" at the resort (really room credit but we&#039;re making nice cards to indicate what it&#039;s for). &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I saw something on Pinterest where a couple had a picture of themselves holding a picture frame that said \"We owe you.\" &amp;nbsp;I thought that was cute and we plan to do that as well in their thank you cards at the rehearsal dinner.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872720,"PostDate":1411416365,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We've been picking up some small, special things for our moms to put in their OOT bags. \u00a0Clear, waterproof cases for their iPads that allow them to use the touch screen and these beach bags that have a flap and mesh bottom for emptying out sand (I think they're called Shake bags). \u00a0We are also giving our dads a cigar bar \"credit\" and moms a spa \"credit\" at the resort (really room credit but we're making nice cards to indicate what it's for). \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I saw something on Pinterest where a couple had a picture of themselves holding a picture frame that said \"We owe you.\" \u00a0I thought that was cute and we plan to do that as well in their thank you cards at the rehearsal dinner.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"seb1230@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.162.29.147","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1390926128,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276377.jpg?_r=1410108720","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"seb1230","Id":276377,"Name":"seb1230","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.179.243.111","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78048,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9453a4de5b59b093d96c558d92f9b854","RawContent":"Great idea on the photo book. I will defiantly be doing that for our parents and I may do one for our grandparents as well. For my dad I was going to orders picture frame from etsy for our father daughter dance. There are some nice ones that have cute sayings.","Attachments":[],"Id":1872739,"PostDate":1411428546,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Great idea on the photo book. I will defiantly be doing that for our parents and I may do one for our grandparents as well. For my dad I was going to orders picture frame from etsy for our father daughter dance. There are some nice ones that have cute sayings.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kcrosby86@msn.com","IpAddress":"142.179.243.111","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1398815231,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Kayla88","Id":277780,"Name":"Kayla88","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.166.74.181","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78048,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4f6d50837465ade93e7b782cfe786972","RawContent":"I was\/still paying for the wedding myself. My husband to be&#039;s job is to show up lol. However his parents sent us a pre wedding gift in the form of a check. So now I feel like we have to do something. So does he and it&#039;s been hard to come up with something they will enjoy. So at this point we r thinking the private dinner on the beach for them. Not sure yet but kind of leaning that way","Attachments":[],"Id":1896830,"PostDate":1432248065,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I was\/still paying for the wedding myself. My husband to be's job is to show up lol. However his parents sent us a pre wedding gift in the form of a check. So now I feel like we have to do something. So does he and it's been hard to come up with something they will enjoy. So at this point we r thinking the private dinner on the beach for them. Not sure yet but kind of leaning that way\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"karryl_tolle1@eku.edu","IpAddress":"50.166.74.181","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1418482887,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281404.jpg?_r=1437212587","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Karryl","Id":281404,"Name":"Karryl","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":19,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
