www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/280304-palmtree99\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">palmtree99<\/span><\/a> I got them on Etsy. The shop is called theHELLOtote. They're called Recovery Kit Mini Emergency Bags. They're really cute!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThank you, I really like them!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cathyr99@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"107.201.33.67","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1412551851,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280304.jpg?_r=1412569727","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":281,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"palmtree99","Id":280304,"Name":"palmtree99","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.6.126.88","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78217,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a59ef9dd92fab8beb0cd15018b93c746","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Love your bag toppers! I hadn&#039;t thought of a \"FBOW\" bag!! Looks like you had a lot of fun making them! I know your guests will enjoy them!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1875799,"PostDate":1413380623,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Love your bag toppers! I hadn't thought of a \"FBOW\" bag!! Looks like you had a lot of fun making them! I know your guests will enjoy them!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Love over 50 is still LOVE!!!<\/p>\n<p>Invitations out! RSVPs in<\/p>\n<p>Us, them (bridal party), + 48 guests!!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"dldincali@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"173.8.177.213","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1399049737,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277818.jpg?_r=1408642386","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":143,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"VegasBride121314","Id":277818,"Name":"VegasBride121314","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.16.242.102","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78217,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"efced0facd263a4140b57101f94cfa4b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Great ideas and inspiration! Thanks for sharing!!! :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I hope I didn&#039;t miss this if you posted already... But where did you find the mini Advil\/Tylenol?!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1876000,"PostDate":1413557856,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Great ideas and inspiration! Thanks for sharing!!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I hope I didn't miss this if you posted already... But where did you find the mini Advil\/Tylenol?!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:#0066cc;\"><strong>- Jennifer and Fr<span><em>\u00e9<\/em><\/span>d<span><em>\u00e9<\/em><\/span>ric -<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,204,204);\"><strong>Playa del Carmen Mexico<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,204,204);\"><strong>December 1st, 2015<\/strong><\/span><\/span>","Email":"wedding@jennyfer.ca","IpAddress":"216.16.242.102","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1413457548,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280665.jpg?_r=1413805399","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JennyZ","Id":280665,"Name":"JennyZ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.77.80.57","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78217,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9ea4f9a95826943136c630ef968d8843","RawContent":"@[member=\"JennyZ\"] thanks!! I got the medicines on Amazon. The provider was Mr. Medical. You can get them at staples for a good price too apparently. They&#039;re just little mini packets with 2 pills in them. I bought 50 packets for $14 I think.","Attachments":[],"Id":1876007,"PostDate":1413561618,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n     