{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.202.144.192","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76753,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1bb1db552fb55ca63fb591945eafcfd8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I have been debating this for my bridesmaids for a gift.\n\nI am definitely getting one for myself but will they like getting this?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Are their any past brides who have some advice&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1852648,"PostDate":1401382910,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I have been debating this for my bridesmaids for a gift.<br>\nI am definitely getting one for myself but will they like getting this?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Are their any past brides who have some advice<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jlynnmape@gmail.com","IpAddress":"199.202.144.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1389380770,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jayejayelynn","Id":275997,"Name":"jayejayelynn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"63.138.247.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76753,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e773369a716b5d5941fb38612b78eddb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Since we are getting married in Mexico we are getting all of the groomsmen a cigar from one of the local shops, and my FI will be taking them out for drinks\/cigar right before the wedding-&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For my ladies, I paid for the reservations at the spa to have hair and makeup done, a bridal spa shower, and satin robes to match the color of the MOH dress.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;I understand how much time and money they are taking to come on this trip with us, and it makes me feel like I can&#039;t do enough lol&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;p.s I found the robes on Amazon- they were a little over $10 each&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1852735,"PostDate":1401445644,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Since we are getting married in Mexico we are getting all of the groomsmen a cigar from one of the local shops, and my FI will be taking them out for drinks\/cigar right before the wedding-<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For my ladies, I paid for the reservations at the spa to have hair and makeup done, a bridal spa shower, and satin robes to match the color of the MOH dress.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0I understand how much time and money they are taking to come on this trip with us, and it makes me feel like I can't do enough lol<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>p.s I found the robes on Amazon- they were a little over $10 each<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amanda.hodges1@snhu.edu","IpAddress":"24.62.217.165","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1398523937,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277733.jpg?_r=1400873765","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":213,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BusyBee280","Id":277733,"Name":"BusyBee280","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"100.2.231.5","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76753,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a1c4da1d98dfca7f30bfed6b09ca6629","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am thinking of doing hair and makeup for the girls...would like to get the robes too so I am at least giving them something.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1853585,"PostDate":1401804336,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am thinking of doing hair and makeup for the girls...would like to get the robes too so I am at least giving them something.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Jamie","Email":"lovinmylilone@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"70.192.94.81","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1400757982,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Nybride525","Id":278074,"Name":"Nybride525","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.38.55.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76753,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"316c48e02dc5c0a63032c5b0cf53bab1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"BusyBee280\"] Do you remember what the vendor&#039;s name was on Amazon?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1853603,"PostDate":1401807929,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277733\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277733-busybee280\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">BusyBee280<\/span><\/a> Do you remember what the vendor's name was on Amazon?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sammy_frog63@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"72.38.55.174","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1381325481,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274116.jpg?_r=1401456666","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SamanthaC","Id":274116,"Name":"SamanthaC","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.174.77.34","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76753,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a80d7d680e927e7de5c167def9d4d9d1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Does anyone have experience with these? Did the bridesmaids actually wear them? Or are they more of a novelty then useful?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I read an article called \"Top 10 Wedding things to stop doing\" or something, and all I can think about is how one of them was about the robes!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1853610,"PostDate":1401808858,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Does anyone have experience with these? Did the bridesmaids actually wear them? Or are they more of a novelty then useful?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I read an article called \"Top 10 Wedding things to stop doing\" or something, and all I can think about is how one of them was about the robes!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nikkicraig10@gmail.com","IpAddress":"204.174.77.34","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395764738,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nikkicraig10","Id":277331,"Name":"nikkicraig10","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.62.217.165",