sDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":10819,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"58e594d3648fb5ecbdfa7bed1118b7fc","RawContent":"I have five BMs and one MOH and I have no clue as to what to give my BMs as a gift. So far I am giving them their accessories for the wedding and a monogrammed beach bag, maybe a sarong and maybe a massage at the spa, but I can&#039;t think of anything else that would not break the bank, but also not so cheap either.\n \n My MOH surprise gift is for her and her husband; i will have it set up for them to renew their vows (they will married 10yrs this year) at a different resort that weekend.\n \n What is everyone getting their BMs?","Attachments":[],"Id":183795,"PostDate":1201899831,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I have five BMs and one MOH and I have no clue as to what to give my BMs as a gift. So far I am giving them their accessories for the wedding and a monogrammed beach bag, maybe a sarong and maybe a massage at the spa, but I can't think of anything else that would not break the bank, but also not so cheap either.<br \/> <br \/> My MOH surprise gift is for her and her husband; i will have it set up for them to renew their vows (they will married 10yrs this year) at a different resort that weekend.<br \/> <br \/> What is everyone getting their BMs?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Latoya & Joseph<\/span><br><span>Rockhouse Hotel<\/span><br><span>September 20, 2008MY WEDDING SLIDESHOW: <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.sungoldphoto.com\/Latoya-Joseph\/\">http:\/\/www.sungoldphoto.com\/Latoya-Joseph\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"toya5@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1186061552,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207583.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"leharris5","Id":207583,"Name":"leharris5","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":10819,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e8b15b2a35d13194de09e322f0e49ffa","RawContent":"I only have a MOH and I am getting her some gorgeous diamond earrings (that I may have to borrow sometime, ha). I love what you already got the girls, maybe add the sarongs in and a pre-wedding mani pedi day at the salon before you all leave?","Attachments":[],"Id":183802,"PostDate":1201900412,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I only have a MOH and I am getting her some gorgeous diamond earrings (that I may have to borrow sometime, ha). I love what you already got the girls, maybe add the sarongs in and a pre-wedding mani pedi day at the salon before you all leave?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i244.photobucket.com\/albums\/gg28\/lucy8144\/DSC_0825.jpg\">http:\/\/i244.photobucket.com\/albums\/g...4\/DSC_0825.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"dakota144@sbcglobal.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1198292553,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208052.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":90,"PhotoHeight":90,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lucy106","Id":208052,"Name":"lucy106","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":10819,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a6dd925c2c05b73c20e2d24115cb2ec8","RawContent":"search the forum for BM gifts, bridesmaids gift, etc. You should find lots of ideas.\n \n I like your plan for your MOH. I bet she will be surprised.","Attachments":[],"Id":183814,"PostDate":1201901112,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                search the forum for BM gifts, bridesmaids gift, etc. You should find lots of ideas.<br \/> <br \/> I like your plan for your MOH. I bet she will be surprised.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"morganleigh03@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.177.182.183","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1182650580,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"rodent","Id":207489,"Name":"rodent","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":10819,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"17e622b48b7c82e32b15fcc1ddc61ab3","RawContent":"The renewal of vows is a great gift for your MOH. \n \n So far I got my bms straw beach bags, bathing suit cover-ups, pjs, passport covers, a book, sunblock, pashminas and body lotion set. I&#039;m going to get barefoot sandals my wedding is on beach, jewelry for ceremony, a personalized surfboard towel, makeup bag filled with travel size toiletries and pay for the bm dresses. I think that&#039;s it, unless I find something else I can&#039;t resist buying :-)","Attachments":[],"Id":183815,"PostDate":1201901212,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                The renewal of vows is a great gift for your MOH. <br \/> <br \/> So far I got my bms straw beach bags, bathing suit cover-ups, pjs, passport covers, a book, sunblock, pashminas and body lotion set. I'm going to get barefoot sandals my wedding is on beach, jewelry for ceremony, a personalized surfboard towel, makeup bag filled with travel size toiletries and pay for the bm dresses. I think that's it, unless I find something else I can't resist buying :-)\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>***Married November 6, 2008***Gavin Born February 28th, 2010***<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/thread\/32855\/danielle-s-paradisus-palma-real-wedding-review-long\">Paradisus Palma Real Wedding Review<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www2.snapfish.com\/snapfish\/thumbnailshare\/AlbumID=260961377\/a=55019552_55019552\/otsc=SHR\/otsi=SALBlink\/COBRAND_NAME=snapfish\/\">Our Professional Wedding Pictures on Snapfish<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"dnllmz@aol.com","IpAddress":"71.168.140.95","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1194543900,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207914.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":299,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DanielleNDerek","Id":207914,"Name":"DanielleNDerek","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":10819,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6aca56c8c18823fa38595eaa06bdc720","RawContent":"I think what you have sounds very nice! If you wanted to add one more thing thats great but if not, that&#039;s prefect what you have. The Knot had some really cute ideas..Im sure you already knew that though...\n \n I was thinking of getting mine their jewelry and placing it in engraved silver jewelry boxes, and a gift car to Sephora or something.","Attachments":[],"Id":183817,"PostDate":1201901238,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I think what you have sounds very nice! If you wanted to add one more thing thats great but if not, that's prefect what you have. The Knot had some really cute ideas..Im sure you already knew that though...<br \/> <br \/> I was thinking of getting mine their jewelry and placing it in engraved silver jewelry boxes, and a gift car to Sephora or something.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lilmsmoff@comcast.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1197990720,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208043.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jacqueline","Id":208043,"Name":"Jacqueline","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":10819,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b27c6be13c37a63eb3ae7ae806857134","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;DanielleNDerek&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;The renewal of vows is a great gift for your MOH. \n \n So far I got my bms straw beach bags, bathing suit cover-ups, pjs, passport covers, a book, sunblock, pashminas and body lotion set. I&#039;m going to get barefoot sandals my wedding is on beach, jewelry for ceremony, a personalized surfboard towel, makeup bag filled with travel size toiletries and pay for the bm dresses. I think that&#039;s it, unless I find something else I can&#039;t resist buying :-)&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;hahaa holy crap i wanna be your bridesmiad too! hahaha","Attachments":[],"Id":183819,"PostDate":1201901279,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>DanielleNDerek<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">The renewal of vows is a great gift for your MOH. <br \/> <br \/> So far I got my bms straw beach bags, bathing suit cover-ups, pjs, passport covers, a book, sunblock, pashminas and body lotion set. I'm going to get barefoot sandals my wedding is on beach, jewelry for ceremony, a personalized surfboard towel, makeup bag filled with travel size toiletries and pay for the bm dresses. I think that's it, unless I find something else I can't resist buying :-)<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>hahaa holy crap i wanna be your bridesmiad too! hahaha\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lilmsmoff@comcast.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1197990720,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208043.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jacqueline","Id":208043,"Name":"Jacqueline","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":10819,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"82aae7d2afc3fad9af3abde3123c5769","RawContent":"we are thinking about taking the wedding party for excursions. I can&#039;t wait, it should be so much fun! \n Danielle- don&#039;t tell my party what you are getting your party or they will be jealous :)","Attachments":[],"Id":183849,"PostDate":1201902401,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                we are thinking about taking the wedding party for excursions. I can't wait, it should be so much fun! <br \/> Danielle- don't tell my party what you are getting your party or they will be jealous <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>My favorite type of vacation, a relaxing one!<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;53;87\/st\/20080512\/e\/Our+wedding%21\/k\/d7b2\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...d7b2\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"albrosious@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1195266473,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207943.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":68,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amandalovesryan","Id":207943,"Name":"amandalovesryan","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":10819,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"41b2593f29a052fa21d833272b31f7fa","RawContent":"Ahh yes! I too have NOOO idea what to get my BM and I have 2 MOH. I want to get them something they will use and love! Can&#039;t wait to see what others post. The last wedding I was MOH my bestfriend got me crocs ( I am a nurse and she knew I had been eyeing sp? them up!) I think personalized may be the way to go!","Attachments":[],"Id":183982,"PostDate":1201909818,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Ahh yes! I too have NOOO idea what to get my BM and I have 2 MOH. I want to get them something they will use and love! Can't wait to see what others post. The last wedding I was MOH my bestfriend got me crocs ( I am a nurse and she knew I had been eyeing sp? them up!) I think personalized may be the way to go!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>**Stace**<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"staceykilpela@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1196713018,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208001.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"staceyandadam","Id":208001,"Name":"staceyandadam","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":10819,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7d2bbd15c50ec485169b9581410f41e9","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt; I was thinking of getting mine their jewelry and placing it in engraved silver jewelry boxes &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I love this idea - I think this is what I&#039;m going to do!","Attachments":[],"Id":183998,"PostDate":1201911041,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"> I was thinking of getting mine their jewelry and placing it in engraved silver jewelry boxes <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I love this idea - I think this is what I'm going to do!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"betsyrohr@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.103.44.199","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1193703120,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207887.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Betsy","Id":207887,"Name":"Betsy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":10819,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a79ad02a75621742df2de2dce69f2351","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;amandalovesryan&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Danielle- don&#039;t tell my party what you are getting your party or they will be jealous :)&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I have a bad shopping addiction. I can&#039;t help myself. If I think something is cute and i have to buy it for someone. Going overboard is a really bad habit of mine!!! You should see what i&#039;m putting in my oot bags, i&#039;m banned from shopping!","Attachments":[],"Id":184062,"PostDate":1201914213,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>amandalovesryan<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Danielle- don't tell my party what you are getting your party or they will be jealous <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I have a bad shopping addiction. I can't help myself. If I think something is cute and i have to buy it for someone. Going overboard is a really bad habit of mine!!! You should see what i'm putting in my oot bags, i'm banned from shopping!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>***Married November 6, 2008***Gavin Born February 28th, 2010***<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/thread\/32855\/danielle-s-paradisus-palma-real-wedding-review-long\">Paradisus Palma Real Wedding Review<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"htt