uthor":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.tickerclub.com\/tickers\/wedding\/preview\/idTicker\/206838\/rulerId\/\/sliderId\/\/\" alt=\"sliderId\"><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"amanda@roamcanada.com","IpAddress":"41.218.252.222","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411393687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279936.jpg?_r=1414239845","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":246,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amanda2016","Id":279936,"Name":"amanda2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.252.47.191","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75627,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a9aef3f25f78b7bf5c63ad1ed316aa3e","RawContent":"[quote name=\"amandankeith\" post=\"1876577\" timestamp=\"1413994523\"]\nWow those are beauitful.. Thanks for the share.[\/quote]Thank you for liking them!\n\nAnd congrats on choosing St Lucia,its one of my favorite favorite island in the whole Caribbean. Have you been there before?\nDid you know that is where they shot Dr Doolittle with Rex Harrison..not really wedding talk,haha","Attachments":[],"Id":1876609,"PostDate":1413990870,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>amandankeith, on 22 October 2014 - 12:15 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Wow those are beauitful.. Thanks for the share.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Thank you for liking them!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And congrats on choosing St Lucia,its one of my favorite favorite island in the whole Caribbean. Have you been there before?<\/p>\n<p>Did you know that is where they shot Dr Doolittle with Rex Harrison..not really wedding talk,haha<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"georgina@pixanphoto.com","IpAddress":"201.166.29.36","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1398717402,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277766.jpg?_r=1411686578","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"PixanPhotography","Id":277766,"Name":"PixanPhotography","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"41.218.245.52","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75627,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1413993420,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4e5712a1fff799ae3f2edb8d04805333","RawContent":"[quote name=\"PixanPhotography\" post=\"1876609\" timestamp=\"1414005270\"]\nThank you for liking them!\n\nAnd congrats on choosing St Lucia,its one of my favorite favorite island in the whole Caribbean. Have you been there before?\nDid you know that is where they shot Dr Doolittle with Rex Harrison..not really wedding talk,haha[\/quote]You&#039;re very welcome! St.Lucia has always been my dream and I am super excited as Its one island I haven&#039;t visited yet.. :))\nI had no idea!! That is so cool I loved that movie!! Thanks for the info I am going to try and include somehow in a fun way for our guests.. =)","Attachments":[],"Id":1876621,"PostDate":1413993395,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>PixanPhotography, on 22 October 2014 - 03:14 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Thank you for liking them!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And congrats on choosing St Lucia,its one of my favorite favorite island in the whole Caribbean. Have you been there before?<\/p>\n<p>Did you know that is where they shot Dr Doolittle with Rex Harrison..not really wedding talk,haha<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>You're very welcome! St.Lucia has always been my dream and I am super excited as Its one island I haven't visited yet.. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>)<\/p>\n<p>I had no idea!! That is so cool I loved that movie!! Thanks for the info I am going to try and include somehow in a fun way for our guests.. =)<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.tickerclub.com\/tickers\/wedding\/preview\/idTicker\/206838\/rulerId\/\/sliderId\/\/\" alt=\"sliderId\"><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"amanda@roamcanada.com","IpAddress":"41.218.252.222","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411393687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279936.jpg?_r=1414239845","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":246,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amanda2016","Id":279936,"Name":"amanda2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.252.47.191","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75627,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"82e5f066622dfd144e00f33baa7e2e72","RawContent":"[quote name=\"amandankeith\" post=\"1876621\" timestamp=\"1414007795\"]\nYou&#039;re very welcome! St.Lucia has always been my dream and I am super excited as Its one island I haven&#039;t visited yet.. :))\nI had no idea!! That is so cool I loved that movie!! Thanks for the info I am going to try and include somehow in a fun way for our guests.. =)[\/quote]\nIts very idyllic and the people are awesome. The bay is called Marigot Bay and there is a bar called Pink Snail Champagne Bar in the films honor..  ;).\nYou will have a ball.","Attachments":[],"Id":1876627,"PostDate":1413996457,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>amandankeith, on 22 October 2014 - 03:56 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>You're very welcome! St.Lucia has always been my dream and I am super excited as Its one island I haven't visited yet.. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>)<\/p>\n<p>I had no idea!! That is so cool I loved that movie!! Thanks for the info I am going to try and include somehow in a fun way for our guests.. =)<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Its very idyllic and the people are awesome. The bay is called Marigot Bay and there is a bar called Pink Snail Champagne Bar in the films honor..\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/>.<\/p>\n<p>You will have a ball.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"georgina@pixanphoto.com","IpAddress":"201.166.29.36","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1398717402,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277766.jpg?_r=1411686578","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"PixanPhotography","Id":277766,"Name":"PixanPhotography","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"41.218.251.213","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75627,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1d7c3ab4424aa5a73ac4265c909347bd","RawContent":"[quote name=\"PixanPhotography\" post=\"1876627\" timestamp=\"1414010857\"]\nIts very idyllic and the people are awesome. The bay is called Marigot Bay and there is a bar called Pink Snail Champagne Bar in the films honor..  ;).\nYou will have a ball.[\/quote]\nthank you.","Attachments":[],"Id":1876724,"PostDate":1414070057,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>PixanPhotography, on 22 October 2014 - 04:47 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Its very idyllic and the people are awesome. The bay is called Marigot Bay and there is a bar called Pink Snail Champagne Bar in the films honor..\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/>.<br>\nYou will have a ball.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br><br>\nthank you.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.tickerclub.com\/tickers\/wedding\/preview\/idTicker\/206838\/rulerId\/\/sliderId\/\/\" alt=\"sliderId\"><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"amanda@roamcanada.com","IpAddress":"41.218.252.222","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411393687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279936.jpg?_r=1414239845","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":246,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amanda2016","Id":279936,"Name":"amanda2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.233.112.15","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75627,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9abb6ce4e9b5716a93f27823af11a6b9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;2016 bride here as well! We won&#039;t be booking our date until the new year as once it&#039;s booked, our guests only have 90 days to put down their deposit at the guaranteed rate. I wouldn&#039;t want them to have to do that before Christmas so we will be confirming right in January. We have decided on the resort (in Playa Del Carmen, Mexico) and look forward to the planning of it all! This site is awesome...it has so many good ideas!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1877579,"PostDate":1414960814,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>2016 bride here as well! We won't be booking our date until the new year as once it's booked, our guests only have 90 days to put down their deposit at the guaranteed rate. I wouldn't want them to have to do that before Christmas so we will be confirming right in January. We have decided on the resort (in Playa Del Carmen, Mexico) and look forward to the planning of it all! This site is awesome...it has so many good ideas!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"robynb7@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.233.112.15","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1409874993,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279694.jpg?_r=1425843817","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":171,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"rbehlke","Id":279694,"Name":"rbehlke","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.146.165.141","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75627,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"84883c22f04e66a51f872d280212cbb3","RawContent":"&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:albums:11264]&lt;\/div&gt;\n[sharedmedia=gallery:albums:17896]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hi all!\n\n\nI would like to welcome you to the best destination wedding site, where you will find lots of information regarding wedding venue locations, details,etc...\n\n\nIf you&#039;d like to you can visit our website www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com and check out our wedding packages, we have a beautiful private beach called Las Caletas in Puerto Vallarta, Mexico, where we make the magic happen with an amazing view and an awesome setting for your ceremony.\n\n\nIf you want to speak with a sales agent for further assistance feel free to contact us at toll free 1.866.731.8152 or e-mail us to info@adventureweddingsvallarta.com\n\n\n\nBest regards,\n\n\nAdventure Weddings.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1878466,"PostDate":1416066021,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div>\n<div><div class='_sharedMediaBbcode'>\n\t<div class='bbcode_mediaWrap clearfix'>\n\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/album\/11264-las-caletas-by-adventure-weddings\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_11264\/tn_gallery_59784_11264_1386230301_178029.jpeg' class='sharedmedia_screenshot cover_img_75' title='Add that special sky lantern touch...'  width='75' height='75'  alt='Add that special sky lantern touch...' id='tn_image_view_40979_cover' \/><\/a>\n\t\t<div class='details'>\n\t\t\t<h5><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/album\/11264-las-caletas-by-adventure-weddings\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>Album: Las Caletas by Adventure Weddings<\/a><\/h5>\n\t\t\t<div>30 images<\/div>\n\t\t\t<div>0 comments<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div class='_sharedMediaBbcode'>\n\t<div class='bbcode_mediaWrap clearfix'>\n\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/album\/17896-las-caletas-adventure-weddings\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17896\/tn_gallery_258213_17896_1427846.jpg' class='sharedmedia_screenshot cover_img_75' title='Aisle'  width='75' height='75'  alt='Aisle' id='tn_image_view_79008_cover' \/><\/a>\n\t\t<div class='details'>\n\t\t\t<h5><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/album\/17896-las-caletas-adventure-weddings\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>Album: Las Caletas - Adventure Weddings<\/a><\/h5>\n\t\t\t<div>21 images<\/div>\n\t\t\t<div>0 comments<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>Hi all!<br><br>\nI would like to welcome you to the best destination wedding site, where you will find lots of information regarding wedding venue locations, details,etc...<br><br>\nIf you'd like to you can visit our website www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com and check out our wedding packages, we have a beautiful private beach called Las Caletas in Puerto Vallarta, Mexico, where we make the magic happen with an amazing view and an awesome setting for your ceremony.<br><br>\nIf you want to speak with a sales agent for further assistance feel free to contact us at toll free 1.866.731.8152 or e-mail us to info@adventureweddingsvallarta.com<br><br><br>\nBest regards,<br><br>\nAdventure Weddings.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dennise@adventureweddingsvallarta.com","IpAddress":"187.146.166.254","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1343044403,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258213.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LasCaletas","Id":258213,"Name":"LasCaletas","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.105.163.238","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75627,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1c08c06dbbaa3a0ebc69a35a2d45dffe","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;2016 bride here! no plans yet but just wanted to pop in and say hi&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1878598,"PostDate":1416236304,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>2016 bride here! no plans yet but just wanted to pop in and say hi<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarahaparrott@gmail.com","IpAddress":"76.105.163.238","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1415641320,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Penny905","Id":281078,"Name":"Penny905","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.7.173.185","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75627,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c543db056c0c0800f753d7f92cf2f2bf","RawContent":"[quote name=\"rbehlke\" post=\"1877579\" timestamp=\"1414975214\"]\n2016 bride here as well! We won&#039;t be booking our date until the new year as once it&#039;s booked, our guests only have 90 days to put down their deposit at the guaranteed rate. I wouldn&#039;t want them to have to do that before Christmas so we will be confirming right in January. We have decided on the resort (in Playa Del Carmen, Mexico) and look forward to the planning of it all! This site is awesome...it has so many good ideas![\/quote]Hi rbehike, just curious as to which resort you&#039;re looking at in Playa. Looking for suggestions. Thanks.","Attachments":[],"Id":1878617,"PostDate":1416249338,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>rbehlke, on 02 November 2014 - 08:40 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>2016 bride here as well! We won't be booking our date until the new year as once it's booked, our guests only have 90 days to put down their deposit at the guaranteed rate. I wouldn't want them to have to do that before Christmas so we will be confirming right in January. We have decided on the resort (in Playa Del Carmen, Mexico) and look forward to the planning of it all! This site is awesome...it has so many good ideas!\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hi rbehike, just curious as to which resort you're looking at in Playa. Looking for suggestions. Thanks.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"njwood000@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.7.173.185","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1405810391,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Msmimi","Id":279087,"Name":"Msmimi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.163.47.9","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75627,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b322f02bc3b0d026bd7dc78c90db9572","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Planning on a February 2016 wedding&amp;nbsp;at Dreams Riviera Cancun&amp;nbsp;- but nothing has been booked yet. I just got in contact with a couple different Travel Agents today to ask prices. I have my heart set on that beautiful resort so I&#039;m&amp;nbsp;hoping the&amp;nbsp;rates won&#039;t be too outrageous.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I considered going without a TA, but have a few older guests and ones that aren&#039;t very tech savvy, so thinking it will just be easier&amp;nbsp;using one. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1878869,"PostDate":1416585737,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Planning on a February 2016 wedding\u00a0at Dreams Riviera Cancun\u00a0- but nothing has been booked yet. I just got in contact with a couple different Travel Agents today to ask prices. I have my heart set on that beautiful resort so I'm\u00a0hoping the\u00a0rates won't be too outrageous.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I considered going without a TA, but have a few older guests and ones that aren't very tech savvy, so thinking it will just be easier\u00a0using one. \u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"xoxo.krista@gmail.com","IpAddress":"198.163.47.9","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1416582110,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281220.jpg?_r=1416597423","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"xoxokrista","Id":281220,"Name":"xoxokrista","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":88,"TotalPages":9,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":80},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
