{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":3,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":303,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1897139,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":283219,"Name":"juliep81","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283219.jpg?_r=1432484519","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1432470070,"LastPoster":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1897139,"PostDate":1432470070,"PostContent":"Okay So my wedding is planned for June 2016 in the Bahamas. I saw Breezes Bahamas and thought tha...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"foxystylinjules@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.4.91.11","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1432468313,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283219.jpg?_r=1432484519","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"juliep81","Id":283219,"Name":"juliep81","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.4.91.11","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79207,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"941fdd4858845616ae373975d5a2050b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Okay So my wedding is planned for June 2016 in the Bahamas. I saw Breezes Bahamas and thought that would be a good idea. They are all inclusive and have a simple wedding for free. My Fiancee said that the place does not have the best reviews and that their wedding ideas look cheaply made. Any brides been there or having their wedding there? We are a small party and don&#039;t need a big over the top wedding. Any place that is all inclusive that is better in Nassau? Open to all suggestions. Thanks.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897139,"PostDate":1432470070,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Okay So my wedding is planned for June 2016 in the Bahamas. I saw Breezes Bahamas and thought that would be a good idea. They are all inclusive and have a simple wedding for free. My Fiancee said that the place does not have the best reviews and that their wedding ideas look cheaply made. Any brides been there or having their wedding there? We are a small party and don't need a big over the top wedding. Any place that is all inclusive that is better in Nassau? Open to all suggestions. Thanks.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"foxystylinjules@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.4.91.11","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1432468313,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283219.jpg?_r=1432484519","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"juliep81","Id":283219,"Name":"juliep81","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.0.142.65","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79207,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"33c63d15a31e40bd5e22c901e7931131","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community, juliep81 and Congrats on your upcoming dw in the Bahamas!!! You&#039;ve come to the right place for lots of great info, advice and suggestions to help with your planning decisions :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you a wonderful journey ahead and all the very BEST!!! cheers, team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;...for some added beach wedding inspiration, here&#039;s an excerpt Linc captured at a recent shoot at the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153270894224487.1073741928.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;RUI Palace Peninsula Cancun&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/11053597_10153270896134487_3685107577044850554_o.jpg\" alt=\"11053597_10153270896134487_3685107577044\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/11164868_10153270897984487_5080327784522285468_o.jpg\" alt=\"11164868_10153270897984487_5080327784522\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/11048721_10153270899074487_106893498643115612_o.jpg\" alt=\"11048721_10153270899074487_1068934986431\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897145,"PostDate":1432481425,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community, juliep81 and Congrats on your upcoming dw in the Bahamas!!! You've come to the right place for lots of great info, advice and suggestions to help with your planning decisions <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you a wonderful journey ahead and all the very BEST!!! cheers, team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>...for some added beach wedding inspiration, here's an excerpt Linc captured at a recent shoot at the <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153270894224487.1073741928.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>RUI Palace Peninsula Cancun<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/11053597_10153270896134487_3685107577044850554_o.jpg\" alt=\"11053597_10153270896134487_3685107577044\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/11164868_10153270897984487_5080327784522285468_o.jpg\" alt=\"11164868_10153270897984487_5080327784522\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/11048721_10153270899074487_106893498643115612_o.jpg\" alt=\"11048721_10153270899074487_1068934986431\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.187","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79207,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e2d602ab35431801c8f6c4cd0ac380f4","RawContent":"Congrats on your engagement and welcome! Unfortunately I don&#039;t have any info on the resort you&#039;re considering. Do you have a travel agent yet? They would be invaluable in helping determine your wedding budget and be able to give you recommendations on resorts where you want to be. I do remember when we were originally looking for a country to get married in, our top 2 were the Bahamas and Jamaica, and I had been at a wedding show here in Toronto. I got talking with a travel agent there and she didn&#039;t have a lot of positive things to say about Breezes. Just that it was showing its age and really needed a facelift. I really don&#039;t kmow if anything has been done since the end of 2010 so I&#039;m afraid I can&#039;t add much more than that. Have you looked at the resort review section here to see what past brides have said about their experiences? It might be worth a look.\n\n\nI hope you find what works best for you. There is also the travel agent associated with this site, Wright Travel. They are destination wedding specialists and I sure would be able. To help you out with information. Good luck and happy planning!","Attachments":[],"Id":1897147,"PostDate":1432483506,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congrats on your engagement and welcome! Unfortunately I don't have any info on the resort you're considering. Do you have a travel agent yet? They would be invaluable in helping determine your wedding budget and be able to give you recommendations on resorts where you want to be. I do remember when we were originally looking for a country to get married in, our top 2 were the Bahamas and Jamaica, and I had been at a wedding show here in Toronto. I got talking with a travel agent there and she didn't have a lot of positive things to say about Breezes. Just that it was showing its age and really needed a facelift. I really don't kmow if anything has been done since the end of 2010 so I'm afraid I can't add much more than that. Have you looked at the resort review section here to see what past brides have said about their experiences? It might be worth a look.<br><br>\nI hope you find what works best for you. There is also the travel agent associated with this site, Wright Travel. They are destination wedding specialists and I sure would be able. To help you out with information. Good luck and happy planning!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79207","Title":"Newbie Looking To Get Married At Breezes Bahamas Resort, Good Or Bad ?","LastPostDate":1432483506},"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
