I just created this for the planner. This is the first rough draft. I have also located the template ofr the cute little wedding day of timeline. When I find I will post the template.<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/i144.photobucket.com\/albums\/r184\/msjlpolk\/thebigdaytimeline.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/i144.photobuc....aytimeline.jpg<\/a><p>\u00a0<\/p><span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"3818\",\"name\":\"Day of timeline-wedding.doc\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":25,\"type\":\"doc\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span><center><\/span><br><br><span>Jenetta - JPMO<\/span><br><br><span>Dreams Resort June 16th, 2007<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;0\/st\/20070616\/e\/Our+Wedding+Day%21%21%21\/dt\/-1\/k\/114e\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...114e\/event.png<\/a><span><a href=\"<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/pregnancy.baby-gaga.com\/\">http:\/\/pregnancy.baby-gaga.com\/<\/a><span>\"><img src=\"<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.baby-gaga.com\/p\/dev065br___.png\">http:\/\/tickers.baby-gaga.com\/p\/dev065br___.png<\/a><span>\" alt=\"pregnant\" border=\"0\" \/><\/a>[link=<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.baby-gaga.com\/%5D%5Bimage\">http:\/\/www.baby-gaga.com\/][image<\/a><span> noborder]<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.baby-gaga.com\/t\/dogdogcrd20080310_-8_Maurice+Sean.png%5B\/image%5D%5B\/link%5D\">http:\/\/tick...<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"msjlpolk@sbcglobal.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1142540820,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206725.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":60,"PhotoHeight":80,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JPMO","Id":206725,"Name":"JPMO","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":961,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ca74f28b91b1f1c966673a0ec8830e41","RawContent":"This site has many templates:\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/weddings.shanbritedesigns.com\/templates.htm\"&gt;Wedding Planning&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":13089,"PostDate":1167260857,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                This site has many templates:<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/weddings.shanbritedesigns.com\/templates.htm' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Wedding Planning<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span><center><\/span><br><br><span>Jenetta - JPMO<\/span><br><br><span>Dreams Resort June 16th, 2007<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;0\/st\/20070616\/e\/Our+Wedding+Day%21%21%21\/dt\/-1\/k\/114e\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...114e\/event.png<\/a><span><a href=\"<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/pregnancy.baby-gaga.com\/\">http:\/\/pregnancy.baby-gaga.com\/<\/a><span>\"><img src=\"<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.baby-gaga.com\/p\/dev065br___.png\">http:\/\/tickers.baby-gaga.com\/p\/dev065br___.png<\/a><span>\" alt=\"pregnant\" border=\"0\" \/><\/a>[link=<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.baby-gaga.com\/%5D%5Bimage\">http:\/\/www.baby-gaga.com\/][image<\/a><span> noborder]<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.baby-gaga.com\/t\/dogdogcrd20080310_-8_Maurice+Sean.png%5B\/image%5D%5B\/link%5D\">http:\/\/tick...<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"msjlpolk@sbcglobal.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1142540820,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206725.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":60,"PhotoHeight":80,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JPMO","Id":206725,"Name":"JPMO","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":961,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c44f4b2ddb7c2b45ffe4d19120fef811","RawContent":"Jenetta - \n \n I see on your itinerary that you are presenting the grandmothers with bouquets in leiu of the bouquet toss! Great idea! I was just thinking about what I could do instead!\n \n How are you planning on that happening? Are you doing it publically or privately? Details for this wonderful idea! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":13140,"PostDate":1167286518,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Jenetta - <br \/> <br \/> I see on your itinerary that you are presenting the grandmothers with bouquets in leiu of the bouquet toss! Great idea! I was just thinking about what I could do instead!<br \/> <br \/> How are you planning on that happening? Are you doing it publically or privately? Details for this wonderful idea! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"valerieveen@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1155319920,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206781.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"VALERIE","Id":206781,"Name":"VALERIE","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":961,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e32333628d6f79f0ce0e939ce4de0066","RawContent":"We&#039;re going to do it publicly. Basically, FI and I will give a short speech about how there marriages inspired us (grandfathers are dead), taught us about weathering the storm blah, blah. In leau of presenting my bouquet to a single lady, I am honored to share my bouquets with our grandmothers. I figured by this time, there won&#039;t be a dry eye in the place.\n \n I will have small bouquets made up instead of giving mine. They aren&#039;t supposed to take it on the plane with them so I am debating creating two in silk or just having them smuggle them back. How bad would it be if customs stopped two lil&#039; old ladies?","Attachments":[],"Id":13145,"PostDate":1167287053,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We're going to do it publicly. Basically, FI and I will give a short speech about how there marriages inspired us (grandfathers are dead), taught us about weathering the storm blah, blah. In leau of presenting my bouquet to a single lady, I am honored to share my bouquets with our grandmothers. I figured by this time, there won't be a dry eye in the place.<br \/> <br \/> I will have small bouquets made up instead of giving mine. They aren't supposed to take it on the plane with them so I am debating creating two in silk or just having them smuggle them back. How bad would it be if customs stopped two lil' old ladies?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span><center><\/span><br><br><span>Jenetta - JPMO<\/span><br><br><span>Dreams Resort June 16th, 2007<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;0\/st\/20070616\/e\/Our+Wedding+Day%21%21%21\/dt\/-1\/k\/114e\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...114e\/event.png<\/a><span><a href=\"<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/pregnancy.baby-gaga.com\/\">http:\/\/pregnancy.baby-gaga.com\/<\/a><span>\"><img src=\"<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.baby-gaga.com\/p\/dev065br___.png\">http:\/\/tickers.baby-gaga.com\/p\/dev065br___.png<\/a><span>\" alt=\"pregnant\" border=\"0\" \/><\/a>[link=<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.baby-gaga.com\/%5D%5Bimage\">http:\/\/www.baby-gaga.com\/][image<\/a><span> noborder]<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.baby-gaga.com\/t\/dogdogcrd20080310_-8_Maurice+Sean.png%5B\/image%5D%5B\/link%5D\">http:\/\/tick...<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"msjlpolk@sbcglobal.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1142540820,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206725.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":60,"PhotoHeight":80,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JPMO","Id":206725,"Name":"JPMO","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":961,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a9efa720f77fbc48d369e77e5b6d4222","RawContent":"Though we didn&#039;t have too many &amp;quot;planned events&amp;quot; This is what we did. We printed them on parchement paper, rolled them up, tied a piece of raffia around them &amp;amp; put them in the Welcome bags. We used a script font :)\n ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n &lt;div align=\"center\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Comic Sans MS\"&gt;&lt;font size=\"4\"&gt;Welcome to Cabo!&lt;\/font&gt;\n \n We are so happy you have come all the way down to Los Cabos to be here for our wedding day. We are going to have a great time! To help you plan you weekend, below is an agenda of events and optional activities that are planned.\n \n Fiesta Night\n FRIDAY, NOVEMBER 10th\n 7:30 PM (Optional)\n Whoever wants to kick off the weekend with a margarita and a little Mexican music, join us at the El Patio Restaurant for fiesta night..\n \n Wedding Rehearsal\n Saturday, November 11th \n The Gazebo at Dreams\n 11:00 AM\n Wedding party and Parents only\n \n Rehearsal Dinner\n Saturday, November 11th \n Portofino Restaurant, Dreams\n 5:30 PM \n Bridal Party and family only (including your significant other). We will meet up with everyone else immediately following the dinner in the Lobby Bar between 7:30 &amp;amp; 8:00 PM.\n \n Deep Sea Fishing\n Saturday, November 11th \n 6:00 AM\n Minervas in Cabo San Lucas\n If you have RSVP\u00e2\u20ac\u2122d, you will need to catch a cab to the Marina to arrive by 6:30 AM. You can all meet at 6:00 AM in the Lobby and catch a cab together. If you haven\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t RSVP\u00e2\u20ac\u2122d, there is still space available. Cost will be $85.00 pp for a full day of fishing. If you are interested, please talk to Rebecca or Marc ASAP. (Unfortunately the bridal party is excluded from this event due to the rehearsal, sorry).\n \n Wedding Ceremony\n Sunday, November 12th \n The Gazebo at Dreams\n 4:30 PM\n Please arrive between 4:00 and 4:30 PM. The ceremony will begin promptly at 4:30. Cocktail hour will immediately follow the ceremony at El Patio restaurant (located next to gazebo).\n \n Wedding Reception\n Sunday, November 12th \n Oceana Pool Terrace\n 6:00 PM\n For dinner and dancing&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":13262,"PostDate":1167408712,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Though we didn't have too many \"planned events\" This is what we did. We printed them on parchement paper, rolled them up, tied a piece of raffia around them & put them in the Welcome bags. We used a script font <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~<br \/> <div align=\"center\"><font face=\"Comic Sans MS\"><font size=\"4\">Welcome to Cabo!<\/font><br \/> <br \/> We are so happy you have come all the way down to Los Cabos to be here for our wedding day. We are going to have a great time! To help you plan you weekend, below is an agenda of events and optional activities that are planned.<br \/> <br \/> Fiesta Night<br \/> FRIDAY, NOVEMBER 10th<br \/> 7:30 PM (Optional)<br \/> Whoever wants to kick off the weekend with a margarita and a little Mexican music, join us at the El Patio Restaurant for fiesta night..<br \/> <br \/> Wedding Rehearsal<br \/> Saturday, November 11th <br \/> The Gazebo at Dreams<br \/> 11:00 AM<br \/> Wedding party and Parents only<br \/> <br \/> Rehearsal Dinner<br \/> Saturday, November 11th <br \/> Portofino Restaurant, Dreams<br \/> 5:30 PM <br \/> Bridal Party and family only (including your significant other). We will meet up with everyone else immediately following the dinner in the Lobby Bar between 7:30 & 8:00 PM.<br \/> <br \/> Deep Sea Fishing<br \/> Saturday, November 11th <br \/> 6:00 AM<br \/> Minervas in Cabo San Lucas<br \/> If you have RSVP\u00e2\u20ac\u2122d, you will need to catch a cab to the Marina to arrive by 6:30 AM. You can all meet at 6:00 AM in the Lobby and catch a cab together. If you haven\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t RSVP\u00e2\u20ac\u2122d, there is still space available. Cost will be $85.00 pp for a full day of fishing. If you are interested, please talk to Rebecca or Marc ASAP. (Unfortunately the bridal party is excluded from this event due to the rehearsal, sorry).<br \/> <br \/> Wedding Ceremony<br \/> Sunday, November 12th <br \/> The Gazebo at Dreams<br \/> 4:30 PM<br \/> Please arrive between 4:00 and 4:30 PM. The ceremony will begin promptly at 4:30. Cocktail hour will immediately follow the ceremony at El Patio restaurant (located next to gazebo).<br \/> <br \/> Wedding Reception<br \/> Sunday, November 12th <br \/> Oceana Pool Terrace<br \/> 6:00 PM<br \/> For dinner and dancing<\/font><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Rebecca<\/span><br><span><center><\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i54.photobucket.com\/albums\/g115\/rebeccaohara\/IMG_1294.jpg\">http:\/\/i54.photobucket.com\/albums\/g1...a\/IMG_1294.jpg<\/a><br><i>Alexander & Juliette - Born 3\/15\/09<\/i><span><\/center><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"rebeccalynne2003@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1137386220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206708.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":88,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"REBECCA","Id":206708,"Name":"REBECCA","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":961,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8d093fe9b64e57ac1865a966a0eb2a16","RawContent":"Here&#039;s the link. I did one for &amp;quot;everyone&amp;quot; and one for bridal party.\n \n Because not everyone was included in the rehearsal and rehearsal dinner.&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;3821&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Welocome letter - everyone.doc&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:27.5,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;doc&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":13263,"PostDate":1167409077,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\