{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":101845,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that racht33 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79407-wedding-dj-apps\/?view=findpost&p=1900708\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"deecol\" I asked on the wedding do app as well and  @\"TinkerSofi\" wrote a great review on it here.. http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79242-dj-app\/\n\nI haven't been able to get the app yet . Waiting to see if I can locate a used I pod just to use for the day! Hope that helps!!\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281952,"Name":"racht33","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281952.jpg?_r=1424197509","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437242168,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":101828,"Title":"liked a post you made in Need To Vent!","Message":"Hello!\n\nvancouverpetunia just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  Thank you Joyce!  You're tips made me smile.  In the end it is definitely about me and my fianc\u00e9 and I'm so thankful to those that have already committed to coming.\n \nVenting on this forum and all the kind words have already made me start feeling better about the...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79405-need-to-vent\/?view=findpost&p=1900683\n","Sender":{"Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1437230410,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":101826,"Title":"liked a post you made in Need To Vent!","Message":"Hello!\n\nvancouverpetunia just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  Thank you <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>  That killed me too when she said she thought I would get a free trip.  The nerve!  I actually read back our conversation because I'm so rattled and realized when she said about having to pay by october she actually said \"why do we have to pay by October, the TRI...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79405-need-to-vent\/?view=findpost&p=1900666\n","Sender":{"Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1437230403,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":101782,"Title":"liked a post you made in Need To Vent!","Message":"Hello!\n\nveryvalentine just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  Thank you <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>  That killed me too when she said she thought I would get a free trip.  The nerve!  I actually read back our conversation because I'm so rattled and realized when she said about having to pay by october she actually said \"why do we have to pay by October, the TRI...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79405-need-to-vent\/?view=findpost&p=1900666\n","Sender":{"Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1435850174","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437176389,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":101750,"Title":"quoted a post you made","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that one of your posts has been quoted by TinkerSofi.\n\nThe post that was quoted can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1900654\n\nThe post that TinkerSofi submitted can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1900682\n\n----------------------------------\n------------ QUOTE ----------\n@\"TinkerSofi\" ahhh 27 days!!! I'm so excited for you!  It's almost here!\n\nWhat day do you leave?\n-----------------------------\n\n\nWe leave on the 9th so our vacation is just 3 weeks away! That's insane and I still don't realize the seriousness of the situation hahah (that everything needs to be done in 3 weeks!!) hahah \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of quoted posts, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437170109,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":101745,"Title":"liked a post you made in Tinkersofi's Planning T...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  ahhh 27 days!!! I'm so excited for you!  It's almost here!\n \nWhat day do you leave?\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1900654\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437170047,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":101733,"Title":"quoted a post you made","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that one of your posts has been quoted by dreamweddings.\n\nThe post that was quoted can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79405-need-to-vent\/?view=findpost&p=1900645\n\nThe post that dreamweddings submitted can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79405-need-to-vent\/?view=findpost&p=1900673\n\n----------------------------------\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nHi Ladies!\n \nI really need to vent, and if anyone will understand it will be you.\n \nI don't even have to say this, we all know that when it comes to destination weddings, some people will be there and book without hesitation, some will say yes and not book, and some will not be able to attend.  What I'm finding extremely difficult to process and understand is the complete lack of communication and respect my own family and \"close\" friends have for me and my fianc\u00e9.\n \nWe get a group rate and reserve seats, give months of advance warning and in every reminder email I have sent I have expressed that they are more than welcome to make their own accommodations, however they may not get the same price or the hotel may not have room for them when they do decide to book.\n \nMy booking deadline is next week.  I have 6 people who have guaranteed me they will book by this date.  One of my friends texted me to let me know she's booking on Saturday, she obviously didn't read the last email I sent where I let everyone know the agency is closed on weekends, it's no problem, she can call Monday, but then I thought, shoot - maybe I should let the others know.  So I text one of my \"close\" girlfriends, she then asks me \"do we have to pay by October? because I can't\".  No problem, you don't have to but there is a early booking bonus included in my rate and you will have to pay that if you miss the deadline and told her to feel free to look into other options.  She then says \"Your wedding is in April LOL, I don't get why we have to pay so early, I travel to resorts quite a bit and they're never sold out in April\".  Trying not to be rude I let her know that I am not psychic and have no way of knowing if the price will go up or down, and if the resort will sell out or not, all I did was negotiate a group rate and reserved some seats so my closest family and friends can hold their spot.  My fianc\u00e9 has worked in travel all his life, we did a lot of research before choosing this resort and date.  The final straw of this conversation:  I tell her, I get it, it is an expense and Colin and I need to have our payment in by October too.  She says: Oh, you guys have to pay?  I just thought you were trying to get a certain amount of people to book so you could get a free trip.  It made me feel like I'm being perceived as a scammer and I should not feel like this when I'm trying to plan my wedding.  Yes, sometimes we get incentives on trips if a certain number of people book, but if she was such a close friend she would have talked to me about how my wedding plans are going so far and realized I am no where near even getting one comp ticket.  It doesn't matter to me, we are getting married, it's an expense, a comp would be a bonus but that's not the reason I arranged a group rate.  I let her know that when we looked at this resort for 2015 a couple weeks before our dates it was sold out so she can take her chances, we ended the conversation by her patronizing me \"Oh really?  I've never seen that, must have been spring breakers. Woooo\"  And we agreed for her to look into other options.  I'm at the point right now where I don't care.  Do what you want.\n \nThe other shocker in my current situation is my Dad's side of the family.  He has 5 siblings, they all have kids and some of them have kids.  I have always been close with them, they know my dad and I have always had a great relationship especially through my parents divorce and we have always stayed in contact.  My Dad will be the only one from his side at my wedding.  I understand not being able to afford it, and that is completely okay, but when my cousin got married in Nova Scotia, they all went.  Another just got engaged that lives there and I'm sure they will all go.  Some are even going down this summer.  When I was trying to collect their addresses for my invites it was so difficult, then I send the invitations and I don't even get a reply, nothing to even say they can't make it.  This really upsets my Dad, so he who is scared to even use a computer posted a FACEBOOK message to his family.  No one responded.  So now he's calling everyone individually, and as the declines roll in, I'm not upset, I'm upset with those family members who my dad has spoken to and they still haven't contacted me, and those family members who he is chasing down, he shouldn't have to chase them down.  He had planned to share a room with one of my cousins, my cousin has ignored every phone call from him, every message from me, but told other family members that he can't commit right now and will probably book later.  Why couldn't he tell one of us that?  My dad was left to find someone to share a room with and luckily a friend of mine from elementary school needed a room-mate.  It makes my Dad really upset, which is not fair to him.\n \nTrying not to let it bother me and focus on the fact that we have 32 of our closest family and friends from Canada and the UK with their deposits down.  That is more than I could ever ask for.\n \nThanks for letting me rant <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n-----------------------------\n\n \n\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nHi Ladies!\n \nI really need to vent, and if anyone will understand it will be you.\n \nI don't even have to say this, we all know that when it comes to destination weddings, some people will be there and book without hesitation, some will say yes and not book, and some will not be able to attend.  What I'm finding extremely difficult to process and understand is the complete lack of communication and respect my own family and \"close\" friends have for me and my fianc\u00e9.\n \nWe get a group rate and reserve seats, give months of advance warning and in every reminder email I have sent I have expressed that they are more than welcome to make their own accommodations, however they may not get the same price or the hotel may not have room for them when they do decide to book.\n \nMy booking deadline is next week.  I have 6 people who have guaranteed me they will book by this date.  One of my friends texted me to let me know she's booking on Saturday, she obviously didn't read the last email I sent where I let everyone know the agency is closed on weekends, it's no problem, she can call Monday, but then I thought, shoot - maybe I should let the others know.  So I text one of my \"close\" girlfriends, she then asks me \"do we have to pay by October? because I can't\".  No problem, you don't have to but there is a early booking bonus included in my rate and you will have to pay that if you miss the deadline and told her to feel free to look into other options.  She then says \"Your wedding is in April LOL, I don't get why we have to pay so early, I travel to resorts quite a bit and they're never sold out in April\".  Trying not to be rude I let her know that I am not psychic and have no way of knowing if the price will go up or down, and if the resort will sell out or not, all I did was negotiate a group rate and reserved some seats so my closest family and friends can hold their spot.  My fianc\u00e9 has worked in travel all his life, we did a lot of research before choosing this resort and date.  The final straw of this conversation:  I tell her, I get it, it is an expense and Colin and I need to have our payment in by October too.  She says: Oh, you guys have to pay?  I just thought you were trying to get a certain amount of people to book so you could get a free trip.  It made me feel like I'm being perceived as a scammer and I should not feel like this when I'm trying to plan my wedding.  Yes, sometimes we get incentives on trips if a certain number of people book, but if she was such a close friend she would have talked to me about how my wedding plans are going so far and realized I am no where near even getting one comp ticket.  It doesn't matter to me, we are getting married, it's an expense, a comp would be a bonus but that's not the reason I arranged a group rate.  I let her know that when we looked at this resort for 2015 a couple weeks before our dates it was sold out so she can take her chances, we ended the conversation by her patronizing me \"Oh really?  I've never seen that, must have been spring breakers. Woooo\"  And we agreed for her to look into other options.  I'm at the point right now where I don't care.  Do what you want.\n \nThe other shocker in my current situation is my Dad's side of the family.  He has 5 siblings, they all have kids and some of them have kids.  I have always been close with them, they know my dad and I have always had a great relationship especially through my parents divorce and we have always stayed in contact.  My Dad will be the only one from his side at my wedding.  I understand not being able to afford it, and that is completely okay, but when my cousin got married in Nova Scotia, they all went.  Another just got engaged that lives there and I'm sure they will all go.  Some are even going down this summer.  When I was trying to collect their addresses for my invites it was so difficult, then I send the invitations and I don't even get a reply, nothing to even say they can't make it.  This really upsets my Dad, so he who is scared to even use a computer posted a FACEBOOK message to his family.  No one responded.  So now he's calling everyone individually, and as the declines roll in, I'm not upset, I'm upset with those family members who my dad has spoken to and they still haven't contacted me, and those family members who he is chasing down, he shouldn't have to chase them down.  He had planned to share a room with one of my cousins, my cousin has ignored every phone call from him, every message from me, but told other family members that he can't commit right now and will probably book later.  Why couldn't he tell one of us that?  My dad was left to find someone to share a room with and luckily a friend of mine from elementary school needed a room-mate.  It makes my Dad really upset, which is not fair to him.\n \nTrying not to let it bother me and focus on the fact that we have 32 of our closest family and friends from Canada and the UK with their deposits down.  That is more than I could ever ask for.\n \nThanks for letting me rant <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n-----------------------------\n\n \n\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nHi Ladies!\n \nI really need to vent, and if anyone will understand it will be you.\n \nI don't even have to say this, we all know that when it comes to destination weddings, some people will be there and book without hesitation, some will say yes and not book, and some will not be able to attend.  What I'm finding extremely difficult to process and understand is the complete lack of communication and respect my own family and \"close\" friends have for me and my fianc\u00e9.\n \nWe get a group rate and reserve seats, give months of advance warning and in every reminder email I have sent I have expressed that they are more than welcome to make their own accommodations, however they may not get the same price or the hotel may not have room for them when they do decide to book.\n \nMy booking deadline is next week.  I have 6 people who have guaranteed me they will book by this date.  One of my friends texted me to let me know she's booking on Saturday, she obviously didn't read the last email I sent where I let everyone know the agency is closed on weekends, it's no problem, she can call Monday, but then I thought, shoot - maybe I should let the others know.  So I text one of my \"close\" girlfriends, she then asks me \"do we have to pay by October? because I can't\".  No problem, you don't have to but there is a early booking bonus included in my rate and you will have to pay that if you miss the deadline and told her to feel free to look into other options.  She then says \"Your wedding is in April LOL, I don't get why we have to pay so early, I travel to resorts quite a bit and they're never sold out in April\".  Trying not to be rude I let her know that I am not psychic and have no way of knowing if the price will go up or down, and if the resort will sell out or not, all I did was negotiate a group rate and reserved some seats so my closest family and friends can hold their spot.  My fianc\u00e9 has worked in travel all his life, we did a lot of research before choosing this resort and date.  The final straw of this conversation:  I tell her, I get it, it is an expense and Colin and I need to have our payment in by October too.  She says: Oh, you guys have to pay?  I just thought you were trying to get a certain amount of people to book so you could get a free trip.  It made me feel like I'm being perceived as a scammer and I should not feel like this when I'm trying to plan my wedding.  Yes, sometimes we get incentives on trips if a certain number of people book, but if she was such a close friend she would have talked to me about how my wedding plans are going so far and realized I am no where near even getting one comp ticket.  It doesn't matter to me, we are getting married, it's an expense, a comp would be a bonus but that's not the reason I arranged a group rate.  I let her know that when we looked at this resort for 2015 a couple weeks before our dates it was sold out so she can take her chances, we ended the conversation by her patronizing me \"Oh really?  I've never seen that, must have been spring breakers. Woooo\"  And we agreed for her to look into other options.  I'm at the point right now where I don't care.  Do what you want.\n \nThe other shocker in my current situation is my Dad's side of the family.  He has 5 siblings, they all have kids and some of them have kids.  I have always been close with them, they know my dad and I have always had a great relationship especially through my parents divorce and we have always stayed in contact.  My Dad will be the only one from his side at my wedding.  I understand not being able to afford it, and that is completely okay, but when my cousin got married in Nova Scotia, they all went.  Another just got engaged that lives there and I'm sure they will all go.  Some are even going down this summer.  When I was trying to collect their addresses for my invites it was so difficult, then I send the invitations and I don't even get a reply, nothing to even say they can't make it.  This really upsets my Dad, so he who is scared to even use a computer posted a FACEBOOK message to his family.  No one responded.  So now he's calling everyone individually, and as the declines roll in, I'm not upset, I'm upset with those family members who my dad has spoken to and they still haven't contacted me, and those family members who he is chasing down, he shouldn't have to chase them down.  He had planned to share a room with one of my cousins, my cousin has ignored every phone call from him, every message from me, but told other family members that he can't commit right now and will probably book later.  Why couldn't he tell one of us that?  My dad was left to find someone to share a room with and luckily a friend of mine from elementary school needed a room-mate.  It makes my Dad really upset, which is not fair to him.\n \nTrying not to let it bother me and focus on the fact that we have 32 of our closest family and friends from Canada and the UK with their deposits down.  That is more than I could ever ask for.\n \nThanks for letting me rant <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n-----------------------------\n\nHey Deecol,\n \nFirst of big big hugs to you... I see this happens quite often with destination wedding.   Great advice from the other ladies as well.   \n \nMy advice I give to all brides to be:\n \n1.  Important people will be there not matter what.\n2.  Consider yourself fortunate you already have 32 guests booked\n3.  Your friend may not know how to tell you, no she cant make it, only coming u with some insane excuses.\n4.  About your AHR, I would wait until the wedding planning stages is done , then make the decision.\n5.  You have done your part, sent reminders , calls etc.  NOW enjoy planning your wedding.\n6.  This is about You and your fiancee, let the people who want to hop on the train enjoy the ride, and those who are n\u00b4t            taking action leave them behind. it will be their loss not yours.\n \nHappy Planning and Im sure you will have a beautiful wedding.  \nJoyce\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of quoted posts, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437157203,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":101729,"Title":"liked a post you made in Wedding Dj Apps?","Message":"Hello!\n\nTNT2015 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  Thank you thank you!\n \nAlways so helpful!  I'm so happy you're still on the forum <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>  We need you!  lol\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79407-wedding-dj-apps\/?view=findpost&p=1900667\n","Sender":{"Id":281976,"Name":"TNT2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281976.jpg?_r=1423183212","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437156538,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":101717,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that calgarybride2015 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79405-need-to-vent\/?view=findpost&p=1900668\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"deecol\"\nI am probably not the one for advice on your last mention of the AHR.  I tend to be one who can hold a grudge and I would probably do that just out of spite.  That said, I didn't have an AHR, honestly never even considered it.    Shawn had mentioned it once for his family back in ON -- he has a GINORMOUS family and there was just no way we could invite them all, but one day we will make it there so I can meet them!     \n \nI tend to agree with your logic though.  Why have a party so they can celebrate you when they didn't even have the decency to RSVP or reply to your msgs\/texts.    But once the frustration has worn off you will see it with new eyes and that's probably the better time to make the decision <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>  Good luck!\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437151389,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":101700,"Title":"liked a post you made in Snswedding2016 Planning Thr...","Message":"Hello!\n\nsnswedding2016 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  I just started reading your planning thread.  Well done so far!!!  And love the necklace idea, it's sentimental, beautiful and especially because you said you're not a big jewellery person you won't feel out of your comfort zone or like it's too much.  What a perfect idea <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/?view=findpost&p=1900659\n","Sender":{"Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437146217,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":100748,"Title":"liked a post you made in Toronto (Gta) Brides Meet U...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  @perianjay Oh don't worry!  I didn't expect you to change the date at all!  Sorry I had to cancel, we need to get away for a few days.\n \nHave a blast, and I can hopefully make the next evening if there is one <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79202-toronto-gta-brides-meet-up\/?view=findpost&p=1900353\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1436821491,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":100504,"Title":"liked a post you made in Vistaprint Wedding Invitati...","Message":"Hello!\n\nKaitlyncrossley just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nYou wonderful ladies are probably all over this already.  But for anyone like myself who didn't find this out until today, you can order a free wedding invitation kit from vistaprint.\n \nIt was hard for me to pick a size, paper thickness etc without physically seeing it, s...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79160-vistaprint-wedding-invitation-kit\/?view=findpost&p=1895688\n","Sender":{"Id":283914,"Name":"Kaitlyncrossley","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283914.jpg?_r=1437257112","PhotoWidth":188,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1436735369,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":98615,"Title":"liked a post you made in Veryvalero's Wedding Pl...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  Did you see the gta bride meet up has changed to Aug 14 - are you free?  Would love to hear about everything and meet you in person!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/?view=findpost&p=1899385\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1435931045,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":98414,"Title":"liked a post you made in Veryvalero's Wedding Pl...","Message":"Hello!\n\nveryvalentine just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  Did you see the gta bride meet up has changed to Aug 14 - are you free?  Would love to hear about everything and meet you in person!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/?view=findpost&p=1899385\n","Sender":{"Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1435850174","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1435842731,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":97937,"Title":"started a new personal conversation with you","Message":"deecol,\n\nNinaK has sent you a new personal conversation entitled \"Help\".\n\nNinaK said:\n======================================================================\nHello, \n\nI'm from Toronto as well planning my destination wedding but not sure if I should get a group package with a travel agent...\nHow is being the feedback from your guests about it?\nAnd can you please send me the contact of the agency you are using?\nThanks\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=showConversation&topicID=10384#msg18812\n","Sender":{"Id":283759,"Name":"NinaK","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1435670400,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":10384},{"Id":97767,"Title":"liked a post you made in Tinkersofi's Planning T...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  Love love love it!  You look amazing!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1899361\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1435588762,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":97714,"Title":"added you as a friend","Message":"deecol,\n\nalastair has successfully added you to their friends list.\n\nManage your friends: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&section=friends&module=profile&do=list\n","Sender":{"Id":283690,"Name":"alastair","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1435576665,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Profile","RelatedItemId":283690},{"Id":97364,"Title":"liked a post you made in Veryvalero's Wedding Pl...","Message":"Hello!\n\nveryvalentine just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  soooo beautiful!!!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/?view=findpost&p=1899380\n","Sender":{"Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1435850174","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1435330187,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":97286,"Title":"liked a post you made in Tinkersofi's Planning T...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  Love love love it!  You look amazing!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1899361\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1435313210,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":97167,"Title":"liked a post you made in Tinkersofi's Planning T...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nWooo Vegas!  I met my fianc\u00e9 there!\n \nI went at the end of August and remember feeling like I was under a hot hand dryer the whole time.  \n \nNice of you to be able to get away before the big day! \n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1899127\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1435273672,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":96829,"Title":"liked a post you made in My Email Stds And Boarding...","Message":"Hello!\n\nKenyetta just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nJust ordered my Invitations, and sent out a save the date email with a link to our wedding website a couple of weeks ago... a bit proud of myself and wanted to share <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n \n \n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79164-my-email-stds-and-boarding-pass-invites\/?view=findpost&p=1895737\n","Sender":{"Id":283674,"Name":"Kenyetta","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283674.jpg?_r=1436387720","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":182,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1435168317,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":96496,"Title":"liked a post you made in Veryvalero's Wedding Pl...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@   Just thought this was funny and had to share.\n \nWe were talking about the wedding (shocker! lol) and I said \"By the way, we're bringing walkie-talkies\" and Colin says \"I already have some, used them when I would go snowboarding in Lake Louise\".  Who saw that one...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/?view=findpost&p=1899100\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1435058962,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":96470,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that TinkerSofi mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/?view=findpost&p=1899103\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"deecol\" that's exactly what we use them for too! hahah See? all about practicality <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1435051634,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":96349,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that Maggietron mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/63282-official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread\/?view=findpost&p=1899066\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"deecol\" Your wedding package covers the cost of the ceremony setup and wedding coordinator, I think at the very least you need the smallest package. You can choose a package and then add things on a la carte, but I don't think you can go without a package at all.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":276860,"Name":"Maggietron","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1434997210,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":95903,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that snswedding2016 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79202-toronto-gta-brides-meet-up\/?view=findpost&p=1898910\n\n----------------------------------\nhey ladies! Yay so glad the date seems to be working out. I'm pretty sure the rooftop patio should be ready for Aug 14. I'll keep you all posted. They should be up and running by July 1st! That's the plan as of right now anyway. It's a huge space so if it is open then we'll have no problem getting a table.  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\nJust starting to do a headcount - I have 6 total so far (including me) do I have that right?\n \n@\"acw271011\"\n@\"perianjay\"\n@\"krystalball\"\n@\"Meandhim\"\n@\"deecol\"\n \nAm I missing anyone??\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1434728682,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":95813,"Title":"liked a post you made in Toronto (Gta) Brides Meet U...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nAug 14th is great for me too <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n \n@  Think we can still get a table on that rooftop?\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79202-toronto-gta-brides-meet-up\/?view=findpost&p=1898882\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1434703475,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":95548,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"deecol,\n\nTlseege has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"GBP Photography\".\n\nTlseege said:\n======================================================================\nSadly, the airfare sale is only for this summer\/fall, so there isn't much of a price break in April of next year.  It'd still be $2500.\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=10129&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":207201,"Name":"Tlseege","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207201.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1434555467,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":10129},{"Id":95311,"Title":"quoted a post you made","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that one of your posts has been quoted by dathotgal.\n\nThe post that was quoted can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79276-i-finally-have-a-wedding-date\/?view=findpost&p=1898649\n\nThe post that dathotgal submitted can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79276-i-finally-have-a-wedding-date\/?view=findpost&p=1898733\n\n----------------------------------\n------------ QUOTE ----------\n@\"dathotgal\"  Congratulations!!!  We have the same wedding date!\n-----------------------------\n\nget this deecol.  wedding date april 30th, my bday may 1st his bday may 2nd\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of quoted posts, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":282047,"Name":"dathotgal","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282047.jpg?_r=1436938666","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1434514302,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":95310,"Title":"liked a post you made in I Finally Have A Wedding Date","Message":"Hello!\n\ndathotgal just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@   Congratulations!!!  We have the same wedding date!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79276-i-finally-have-a-wedding-date\/?view=findpost&p=1898649\n","Sender":{"Id":282047,"Name":"dathotgal","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282047.jpg?_r=1436938666","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1434514266,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":94629,"Title":"liked a post you made in My Email Stds And Boarding...","Message":"Hello!\n\ncalgarybride2015 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nFinished product, printed and in it's holder <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n \n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79164-my-email-stds-and-boarding-pass-invites\/?view=findpost&p=1898466\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1434191354,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"113","TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":90},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":4,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}